## 7. Non-Functional Testing Requirements

| Category | Requirement | Test Scenario |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Performance** | < 2s Page Load | Load Parent Dashboard with 100+ historical activities. |
| **Security** | Zero PII Leak | Run automated pen-test on `uup-sync` endpoint. |
| **Accessibility** | WCAG 2.1 AA | Run "Lighthouse" audit on Child Dashboard with Dyslexia Mode active. |
| **Resilience** | Offline Sync | Disconnect Mobile App; Complete Quest; Reconnect. Verify sync. |

---

## 8. Final Acceptance Criteria (The "Go/No-Go" Checklist)
1.  **Safety:** 100% pass on COPPA/GDPR audit tests.
2.  **Accuracy:** > 95% accuracy in AI Socratic scaffolding.
3.  **Sync:** < 5s latency for cross-platform data ingestion.
4.  **UX:** < 3 clicks for a parent to approve a quest or release funds.
